      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "absolutely, when they tried this with \"consumable items\" I was appalled and im equally against the idea of \"temporary\" items, they are pushing their luck with vrc+ specific items like the trampoline but the broom being temporary is a bad move.\n\nidk why theyre trying it considering the backlash for the consumable items, the $2 million dollar goal for a snow gun, and making vrc+ exclusive items",
